{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Arise, go up, etc., and dwell there, etc.</b> The reason He said ״וְשֶׁב שָׁם״ — meaning: even though he dwells in the land of Canaan, dwell there and do not fear them." "<b>Or</b> it may mean <b>and dwell there</b> and do not dwell here, for harm is commonly found there in the place of the breach." "<b>Or</b> it alludes in this way: <b>and dwell there</b> — meaning, there is where you should have dwelt and not in this place, for it is not fitting to give rest for your feet until there; and make an altar, etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:46:04.283459083Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}